  <entry>
    <title>Hexo+Github+Fluid Pages搭建个人博客</title>
    <link href="/2025/06/27/Hexo-Github-Pages%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/"/>
    <url>/2025/06/27/Hexo-Github-Pages%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="Hexo-Fluid-Github-Pages-部署个人博客"><a href="#Hexo-Fluid-Github-Pages-部署个人博客" class="headerlink" title="Hexo + Fluid + Github Pages 部署个人博客"></a>Hexo + Fluid + Github Pages 部署个人博客</h2><h3 id="参考教程："><a href="#参考教程：" class="headerlink" title="参考教程："></a>参考教程：</h3><p><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/yaorongke/article/details/119089190">GitHub Pages + Hexo搭建个人博客网站，史上最全教程</a></p><p><a href="https://nikolahuang.github.io/2024/03/19/hexo-fluid%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E5%B9%B6%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%88%B0github/">hexo+fluid搭建个人博客网站并部署到github | Anderson Blog</a></p><p><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/developer/article/1504684">Git的使用–如何将本地项目上传到Github（三种简单、方便的方法）（二）（详解）</a></p><p><a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/start/#%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA-hexo-%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2">开始使用 | Hexo Fluid 用户手册</a></p><p>hexo官方文档：<a href="https://hexo.io/zh-cn/docs/">中文文档</a></p><p>注：作者没有完全按照第一个教程来，搞了一半就跑到另一边去搜索Git的使用了，尝试在cmd里面用git push和git pull之类的部署，也想提前学一下git的用法，但是遇到了下面写的问题。参考教程使用的是push master命令，但是现在github默认的展示界面是main分支，需要设置为master分支后即可显示部署的界面。最后部署成功还是装了hexo_deployer_git的。</p><p>创建文章并部署到Gtihub Pages：</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">hexo new passage_name<br>hexo <br>hexo clean # 清除缓存<br>hexo generate # 生成静态网页 hexo g<br>hexo deploy # 部署 hexo d<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="遇到的问题："><a href="#遇到的问题：" class="headerlink" title="遇到的问题："></a>遇到的问题：</h3><ol><li>git无法push到仓库中，报错代码</li></ol><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">remote: Requested host does not match any Subject Alternative Names (SANs) on TLS certificate [07ab4aeba14c3ad62d56a5b882bb7dc183c04d20eda6a2449c47f4749d189f6a] in use with this connection.<br>remote:<br>remote: Visit https://www.fastly.com/documentation/guides/concepts/errors/#routing-errors for more information.<br>fatal: unable to access &#x27;https://github.com/roy-lei/roy-lei.github.io.git/&#x27;: The requested URL returned error: 421<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>ssh无法连接，测试连接<code>ssh -T git@github.com</code>时报错，报错代码</li></ol><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">ssh: connect to host github.com port 22: Connection timed out<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>解决：git bash进入，unix，vi编辑器，创建config并编辑其内容，将git连接设置为443端口连接。</p><p>参考资料：<a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/shamo89/p/17645206.html">本地连github出错“ssh: connect to host github.com port 22: Connection timed out”，如何解决？</a></p><p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/15589682/how-to-fix-ssh-connect-to-host-github-com-port-22-connection-timed-out-for-g">How to fix “ssh: connect to host github.com port 22: Connection timed out” for git push&#x2F;pull&#x2F;… commands?</a></p><h3 id="Fluid使用"><a href="#Fluid使用" class="headerlink" title="Fluid使用"></a>Fluid使用</h3><p>hemes\img路径下存放图片，fluid文件夹下_config.ym文件中修改</p><p>fluid背景图改变：yml文件中的banner_img</p><p>其他记录：</p><ol><li>Hexo默认_config.yml中theme为landscape，language为en</li><li><code>source/about/index.md</code>下面初始只有tittle和date</li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
